    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2027569362555834681",
      "url": "https://x.com/HYDTP/status/2027569362555834681",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/HYDTP/status/2027569362555834681",
      "text": "#HYDTPinfo \n🚦 TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚦\nIn view of the ongoing Steel Flyover & Underpass construction works under H-CITI at Jubilee Hills Check Post, KBR Park Entrance, and Mugdha Junction, pillar works will commence at Road No. 2, Banjarahills under the limits of  @shotr_bhills  from 27-02-2026.\n👉 TRAFFIC DIVERSION & ALTERNATE ROUTES\n1️⃣ From NFCL → Srinagar Colony / Sagar Society / KBR Park / Jubilee Hills Check Post / Rd 36 & 45 / Cable Bridge\n• Diversion at Srinagar Colony T-Junction & Sagar Society\n• Proceed via Srinagar Colony Main Road → Indiranagar Labour Adda → Rd No.5 Jubilee Hills → Venkatagiri X Roads (Rd No.10 Jubilee Hills) → Left towards Jubilee Hills Check Post\n2️⃣ From Rd 36 & 45 Jubilee Hills → NFCL\n• Diversion at Jubilee Hills Check Post → Venkatagiri Rd No.2 → Yousufguda Basti → Yousufguda Check Post → Maitrivanam → Ameerpet → Indiranagar Labour Adda → Srinagar Colony → Value Zone → Panjagutta Main Road\n3️⃣ From KCP & Rd No.1 Banjara Hills → KBR Park / Jubilee Hills Check Post / Rd 36\n• Take Rd No.10 Banjara Hills → Cancer Hospital → Left via Agrasen Island → Bharatiya Vidya Bhavan → Rd No.45 Jubilee Hills\n4️⃣ From Masab Tank → KBR Park / Jubilee Hills Check Post\n• Left at Virinchi Hospital → Agrasen Island → Bharatiya Vidya Bhavan → Rd No.45 Jubilee Hills\n⚠️ Note: Diversions will be implemented only on a need basis.\n🙏 Motorists are requested to plan travel accordingly and follow traffic police instructions.\n#TrafficAdvisory #HyderabadTraffic #TrafficDiversion #RoadSafety #DriveSafe",
